### ScarborMusic — Comment System API Tests
### Prerequisite: Login first

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 0. Auth
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "testdev@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### Get current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Post Comments
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1a. Post a top-level comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID",
  "content": "This is a great song! Really enjoying the beat."
}

### Expected: 201 { "data": { "id": "...", "content": "...", "user": {...} } }

### 1b. Reply to a comment (replace COMMENT_ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID",
  "content": "Totally agree with you!",
  "parentId": "REPLACE_WITH_COMMENT_ID"
}

### 1c. Deep reply (level 2 — reply to a reply)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID",
  "content": "This is a level 2 reply",
  "parentId": "REPLACE_WITH_REPLY_ID"
}

### 1d. Empty content (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID",
  "content": ""
}

### 1e. Too long content (> 1000 chars, should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID",
  "content": ""
}

### 1f. Unauthenticated (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: access_token=invalid

{
  "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID",
  "content": "Test"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. Get Comments
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2a. Latest comments (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments?songId=REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID&page=1&pageSize=20

### Expected: 200 { "data": { "comments": [...], "total": N, "pages": M } }
### Each comment includes: user, replies (up to 3 levels deep)

### 2b. Hot comments (sorted by likes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments?songId=REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID&sort=hot

### 2c. Paginated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments?songId=REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID&page=2&pageSize=5

### 2d. Missing songId (should return 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. Edit & Delete Comments
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3a. Edit comment (owner only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/REPLACE_WITH_COMMENT_ID
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "content": "Updated: This is an even better song!"
}

### 3b. Edit someone else's comment (should return 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/OTHER_USER_COMMENT_ID
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "content": "Hacked content"
}

### 3c. Delete comment (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/REPLACE_WITH_COMMENT_ID

### Expected: 200 { "message": "Comment deleted" }

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. Like / Unlike Comments
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4a. Like a comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/REPLACE_WITH_COMMENT_ID/like

### Expected: { "data": { "isLiked": true, "likeCount": 1 } }

### 4b. Unlike (toggle — call again)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/REPLACE_WITH_COMMENT_ID/like

### Expected: { "data": { "isLiked": false, "likeCount": 0 } }

### 4c. Unauthenticated like (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/REPLACE_WITH_COMMENT_ID/like
Cookie: access_token=invalid

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5. Rate Limiting
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 5a-5e. Post 5 comments in quick succession (all should succeed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID", "content": "Rate limit test 1" }
###

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID", "content": "Rate limit test 2" }

### 5f. 6th comment in 30 seconds (should return 429)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID", "content": "Rate limit test 6 - should fail" }

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 6. Cache Verification
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Verify comment count cache in Redis:
# docker exec scarbormusic-redis redis-cli GET "comment:count:{songId}"
# Expected: Total count as string

# Verify like tracking:
# docker exec scarbormusic-redis redis-cli SMEMBERS "comment:likes:{commentId}"
# Expected: Set of userId strings
